#include "src/config.h"

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PreBattle_1
Surprised to see someone my age?\nI promise you, I'm not weak.

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PlayerWin_1
I guess dropping out of school\nwasn't so smart[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PlayerLose_1
Heh, I told you I wasn't a\npushover!

#ifndef UNBOUND

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PreBattle_2
I left school to be here[.]\pI won't let you stand between me\nand greatness!

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PlayerWin_2
That was a good battle!\nI look forward to our rematch.

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PlayerLose_2
You fight worse than my grandma!\nThough Grandma's a tough cookie[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PreBattle_3
I'm just a young kid, you should\ngo easy on me!

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PlayerWin_3
Waaah! I'm telling on you!

#org @sFrontierText_Youngster_PlayerLose_3
Beaten by a little kid[.]\nHow can you sleep at night?

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PreBattle_1
The way of the Bug Catcher!\nBear witness to it!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PlayerWin_1
All hail Bug Catchers!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PlayerLose_1
This is the way of the Bug\nCatcher!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PreBattle_2
I'll snag you with my net!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PlayerWin_2
Hey! Don't run away!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PlayerLose_2
It's in the bag!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PreBattle_3
I catch and raise all sorts of Bug\nPok\emon.

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PlayerWin_3
I need to raise my Pok\emon some\nmore!

#org @sFrontierText_Bugcatcher_PlayerLose_3
See? I've raised them pretty good.

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PreBattle_1
I'm on the lookout for adorable\naccessories.

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PlayerWin_1
I wish I could dress up!

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PlayerLose_1
Let me know if you find any nice\naccessories!

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PreBattle_2
I make it a policy to wear\nminiskirts!

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PlayerWin_2
What's your policy?

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PlayerLose_2
Miniskirts are the ultimate!

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PreBattle_3
Here goes!

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PlayerWin_3
How could you bully a poor little\ngirl?

#org @sFrontierText_Lass_PlayerLose_3
Caught you snoozing!

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PreBattle_1
The sea, my beautiful sea!

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PlayerWin_1
I want to become a big man.\nBig like the sea big.

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PlayerLose_1
Oh[.] I hear them[.]\pI hear the sound of waves[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PreBattle_2
I'm the Sailor among Sailors!\nI was born on the high seas!

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PlayerWin_2
Urp[.] Gweh[.]\pSo, when I get up on land, I get\nno-motion sickness[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PlayerLose_2
The waves rocked me to sleep!\nThe sea was my mother!

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PreBattle_3
Come on! Take a run at me! I can\ntake it!

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PlayerWin_3
Good job! Way to overcome my size!

#org @sFrontierText_Sailor_PlayerLose_3
So, what'd you think?\nI was too burly for you to handle?

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PreBattle_1
My Pok\emon trained in forests.

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PlayerWin_1
I'm going back to the forest.

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PlayerLose_1
It's the power of the forests.

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PreBattle_2
The indefatigable Camper makes his\nstand!

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PlayerWin_2
I wish I could become your\ndevotee.

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PlayerLose_2
You can become a devotee if you'd\nlike.

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PreBattle_3
Hunh? Where is everyone?

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PlayerWin_3
I came to camp, but I think I got\nseparated from my friends[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Camper_PlayerLose_3
Hey, guys! Where are you?!

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PreBattle_1
I'll battle you like I'm on a\npicnic!

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PlayerWin_1
Pretending this is a picnic won't\nlet me win.

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PlayerLose_1
Lalala!

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PreBattle_2
Win or lose, let's not bear any\ngrudges.

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PlayerWin_2
Oh, you! Don't ever forget this!

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PlayerLose_2
Yay, yay, yay! We did it!

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PreBattle_3
I'll teach you what's fun about\nbattling.

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PlayerWin_3
Oh, my, that was inspiring!\nYou're the greatest!

#org @sFrontierText_Picnicker_PlayerLose_3
Battling me was fun, wasn't it?

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PreBattle_1
No one loves Pok\emon more than me!\nNo one!

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PlayerWin_1
Grr[.]\pYour love of Pok\emon is stronger\nthan mine?

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PlayerLose_1
Fuhaha! Looks like my love for\nPok\emon trumped yours!

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PreBattle_2
OK, show me your favorite Pok\emon.\nDon't be shy now, come on.

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PlayerWin_2
I see! Cute, and yet tough.

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PlayerLose_2
I see[.]\pCute but on the weak side.

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PreBattle_3
I have my Pok\emon. I don't need\nanything else.

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PlayerWin_3
Isn't that the same for you?\nIsn't it?

#org @sFrontierText_Pokemaniac_PlayerLose_3
With my Pok\emon, I can be happy\nevery day.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PreBattle_1
I have considered every possible\noutcome.\pYou have a 3% chance of\nbeating me.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PlayerWin_1
What? You have defied the odds!

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PlayerLose_1
Clearly you should return to\nschool.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PreBattle_2
I know every Pok\emon's individual\nstrengths and weaknesses.\pThe odds are not in your favour.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PlayerWin_2
Hmm[.] I need to study more.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PlayerLose_2
You are merely a statistic,\nconforming to the norm.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PreBattle_3
You are no match for my intellect.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PlayerWin_3
You are clearly in the 97th\npercentile. Impressive.

#org @sFrontierText_Supernerd_PlayerLose_3
Another match to analyze and learn\nfrom.

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PreBattle_1
You should aspire to the Hiker's\nway of life!

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PlayerWin_1
Now, come on now!\nYou should look up to the way I\llive!

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PlayerLose_1
You see? You love my lifestyle,\ndon't you?

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PreBattle_2
Howdy! It's a long way away from\nthe mountains here!

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PlayerWin_2
I have hay fever[.]\phahahaaACHOOO!!

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PlayerLose_2
Hahah! Keep it coming!

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PreBattle_3
Ho there!\pYou are a mountain standing in my\nway, aren't ya?

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PlayerWin_3
Grrr[.] My victory has disappeared\nin a crevasse[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Hiker_PlayerLose_3
Yahoooooo! Yahoooooooo!\nHear my cry of triumph!

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PreBattle_1
Those stupid security guards won't\nlet me bike freely around here[.]\pI'll take out my anger on you!

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PlayerWin_1
What?! My bike is out of gas!

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PlayerLose_1
Eat dust, loser!

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PreBattle_2
After our battle, we should race!

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PlayerWin_2
Noooo! Mommy!

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PlayerLose_2
And yet another falls prey to the\nmight of my bike!\lHeh heh heh.

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PreBattle_3
Can you keep up with me at a full\nrun?

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PlayerWin_3
Ugh[.]\pThere's no way I can beat you.

#org @sFrontierText_Biker_PlayerLose_3
If you can't beat me in a battle,\nthere's no way you can beat me in\la bike race.

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PreBattle_1
I was a thief, but I went straight\nas a Trainer.

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PlayerWin_1
I surrender!

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PlayerLose_1
Too late to surrender!

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PreBattle_2
If a Pok\emon has the ability\nPickpocket, does that make it a\lthief-type?

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PlayerWin_2
I wish there was a thief Pok\emon.\nI'd use that to win!

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PlayerLose_2
I get this uncontrollable urge to\nsteal other people's streaks.

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PreBattle_3
I'm calling myself "The Doodler\",\nand with the simple addition of a\lsmall burglar's mask, I achieve\lutter anonymity.

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PlayerWin_3
A good politician is quite as\nunthinkable as an honest burglar.

#org @sFrontierText_Burglar_PlayerLose_3
We burglars know there's more than\none way to skin a streak.

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PreBattle_1
It was me who put up the buildings\naround these parts.

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PlayerWin_1
My dream is to make a building\ntaller than a mountain!

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PlayerLose_1
So, what do you think?\nCool stuff, huh?

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PreBattle_2
I'll scrap you.

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PlayerWin_2
Think ecology. Think green.

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PlayerLose_2
I'll recycle you.

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PreBattle_3
Out of the way!\nI've got deliveries to make!

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PlayerWin_3
All the delivering I do every\nday[.]\pI've got deep muscle pain!

#org @sFrontierText_Worker_PlayerLose_3
What? You want me to deliver you\nsomewhere, too?

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PreBattle_1
Fish, fish, fish, that's what I\ndo! I'm gonna fish it all up!

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PlayerWin_1
Oh, waah!\nI let that get away!

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PlayerLose_1
Kahahah!\nI am at the top of my game!

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PreBattle_2
My cohorts call me the emperor of\nfishing!

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PlayerWin_2
Why the emperor of fishing?\nIt's an ancient Chinese legend[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PlayerLose_2
I landed another big one today!

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PreBattle_3
My fishing-rod-handling technique\nis the best.\pCheck it out!

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PlayerWin_3
How I handle my fishing rod has\nnothing to do with battling[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Fisherman_PlayerLose_3
See it?\nSurprised, I bet!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PreBattle_1
All right!\nLet's play a game!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PlayerWin_1
Drat!\nCame up short!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PlayerLose_1
Things didn't work for you today.

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PreBattle_2
I'm a rambling, gaming dude!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PlayerWin_2
Missed the big chance!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PlayerLose_2
I'm a rambling, gaming dude!\nI'm on a winning streak!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PreBattle_3
Competition!\nI can't get enough!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PlayerWin_3
I had a chance!

#org @sFrontierText_Gambler_PlayerLose_3
You can't be a coward in the world\nof Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PreBattle_1
My beauty is what makes me\nstrong.

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PlayerWin_1
You're beautiful[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PlayerLose_1
You weren't ready for my beauty.

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PreBattle_2
This may hurt a little bit, but\nwe'll be done quick.\pHold still!

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PlayerWin_2
Ooh, no!\nThat hurts!

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PlayerLose_2
There!\nDone!

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PreBattle_3
Lately, I've had a lot to worry\nabout[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PlayerWin_3
You just added to my worries[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Beauty_PlayerLose_3
Winning makes all my worries seem\ntrivial!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PreBattle_1
Come to know defeat[.]\pLearn what it means to battle[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerWin_1
The defeated merely slink away[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerLose_1
I see you becoming ever more\npowerful[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PreBattle_2
Look into my eyes!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerWin_2
My power of suggestion failed to\ncharm you!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerLose_2
You fell under my spell!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PreBattle_3
[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerWin_3
I focused my mind in silence[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerLose_3
[.]Did it.

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PreBattle_4
Close your eyes and count[.]\pSlow[.]\nSlower[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerWin_4
Tch[.]\pI thought I could lull you to\nsleep.

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerLose_4
That was the countdown to my\nvictory!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PreBattle_5
My powers!\nThere's no trickery about them!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerWin_5
There really is no trickery[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerLose_5
This is psychic power!

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PreBattle_6
Twirl, twirl, twirl[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerWin_6
Ooorgh[.]\pMy head's spinning[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Psychic_PlayerLose_6
Are you feeling dizzy?

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PreBattle_1
Oh, yeah! I'm feeling it!\nI'm tuned in to your wavelength!

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PlayerWin_1
Tch! Losing threw off my rhythm!

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PlayerLose_1
Tadaaaah!

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PreBattle_2
You should channel your feelings\ninto songs with sincerity, man.

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PlayerWin_2
The way I feel now is kind of\nfolksy.

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PlayerLose_2
The way I feel now?\nIt's rock!

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PreBattle_3
Let's get this session on!

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PlayerWin_3
My dream of a world tour[.]\pIt seems so far away[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Guitarist_PlayerLose_3
You're obviously short on\npractice.

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PreBattle_1
Howdy!\nAre you a member of my fan club?

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PlayerWin_1
Oh, so you're not a fan[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PlayerLose_1
Lalalah[.]\nMy Pok\emon, I send them out,\lall the girls scream and shout!

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PreBattle_2
Shard de Battle!\nShard de Battle!\pYah, yah!

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PlayerWin_2
Yah, yah!\nShard de lose!

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PlayerLose_2
Yah, yah!\nShard de win!

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PreBattle_3
Behold my dexterity and grace!

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PlayerWin_3
Whew! That was a jolt!

#org @sFrontierText_Juggler_PlayerLose_3
Behold! You've been dazzled by my\nprized Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PreBattle_1
The credo of the Dragon Tamer!\nNumber one!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PlayerWin_1
Even in defeat, roar!\nRoar with your dragon!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PlayerLose_1
In victory, roar!\nRoar with your dragon!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PreBattle_2
See it! Feel it! The ultimate\npower[.]\pProbably!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PlayerWin_2
The title of the ultimate\nprobably!\pI confer it on you!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PlayerLose_2
There is no defeat for me, the\nultimate[.]\pProbably!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PreBattle_3
Mighty! Like a dragon!

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PlayerWin_3
[.]Urf[.]\pI wanted to be strong[.]

#org @sFrontierText_DragonTamer_PlayerLose_3
Strong, I am!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PreBattle_1
Fly, fly, fly!\nWe're going to rule this battle!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PlayerWin_1
We're gonna crash!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PlayerLose_1
Zoom!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PreBattle_2
Now hear me!\pThe Bird Keeper's credo number\none!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PlayerWin_2
Rest your wings on a loss!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PlayerLose_2
Soar high on a win!

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PreBattle_3
There's lots in life that doesn't\ngo the way you want.

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PlayerWin_3
See[.]?

#org @sFrontierText_Birdkeeper_PlayerLose_3
Yippee!\nThings went my way!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PreBattle_1
A battle is deadly earnest!\nNot a moment of inattention!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PlayerWin_1
I seemed to have let my mind\nwander[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PlayerLose_1
Never let down your guard!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PreBattle_2
My spirit burns, my fists are\nsteel, and my sweat cascades!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PlayerWin_2
I've fallen in defeat?\nGw-gwaaah!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PlayerLose_2
I sweated more.\nThat makes me the victor!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PreBattle_3
I only know how to go at full\npower, even against a younger\lopponent!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PlayerWin_3
Please! Let me call you Master\nTrainer from now on!

#org @sFrontierText_Blackbelt_PlayerLose_3
Full power is how I win!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PreBattle_1
My Pok\emon have black belt-level\nstrength!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PlayerWin_1
I rarely meet anyone who's better\nthan me[.]

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PlayerLose_1
You've been humiliated!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PreBattle_2
OK, OK!\nLet's be quick about this!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PlayerWin_2
Yup! Good going!\nI like the way you battle!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PlayerLose_2
Yeah! Let's do this again!\n[.]Oops. You're out of Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PreBattle_3
Hiyah!\nThere's no holding anything back!

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PlayerWin_3
I[.] I concede! I think you're on a\ndifferent level[.]

#org @sFrontierText_BattleGirl_PlayerLose_3
Hiyah! I put you in your place!\nYou better appreciate it!

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PreBattle_1
It's the power of science!

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerWin_1
It's inconceivable[.]\pHow could the power of science be\ndefeated?

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerLose_1
Did you see? Were you amazed?\nThat's the power of science!

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PreBattle_2
Charge, my Pok\emon!\pDemonstrate the fruits of our\nexperimentation!

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerWin_2
What kind of experiments?\nThat's classified.

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerLose_2
Yes, my Pok\emon proved my theory!\nI'll get my professorship now!

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PreBattle_3
I dropped my glasses.\nI can't see straight.

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerWin_3
I guess I lost.\nI can't see enough to tell.

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerLose_3
I guess I won.\nI can't see enough to tell.

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PreBattle_4
Steadily and surely. You build\nfrom the little things up.

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerWin_4
But I did things steadily and\nsurely[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Scientist_PlayerLose_4
Steadily and surely is how I won!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PreBattle_1
You're no good at all.\nI'd better teach you.

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerWin_1
You've got good skills. You tried\nhard, too. Excellent!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerLose_1
No, no, this won't do at all.\nUp on your feet. Never give up!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PreBattle_2
Why get all intellectual about\nthings?\pIf it's fun, why question it?

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerWin_2
So I lost! If it's fun, it's cool!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerLose_2
See, I can still win.\nI don't see a problem!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PreBattle_3
My ace Pok\emon are on the go!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerWin_3
I like the sense you show!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerLose_3
You surprise me! Not too shabby!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PreBattle_4
OK, bring it!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerWin_4
Hoh! You are tough!\nGive me a rematch!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerLose_4
Hah! Too weak! Keep trying!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PreBattle_5
I've caught you now.\nGive up.

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerWin_5
How could this be[.]?

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerLose_5
You weren't bad.\nLet's meet again.

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PreBattle_6
You need to be serious with me!

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerWin_6
OK[.]\pQuite remarkable[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Acetrainer_PlayerLose_6
Oh? That's it?

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PreBattle_1
Hmhm[.]\pI must say I like the look in your\neyes.

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PlayerWin_1
Your eyes shine brighter than any\nbig gemstone I keep at home!

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PlayerLose_1
Your eyes remain unclouded in\ndefeat. Like jewels they are!

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PreBattle_2
When I was your age, I was quite\nthe daredevil, I must say.

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PlayerWin_2
I daresay, you're quite the\ndaredevil yourself!

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PlayerLose_2
Seeing you reminds me of my own\nwild youth.

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PreBattle_3
I shall regress to my childhood\nfor this battle.

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PlayerWin_3
You're no ordinary trainer.

#org @sFrontierText_Gentleman_PlayerLose_3
You still got a long road,\nyoung one.

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PreBattle_1
I like rivers more than the sea.\nWhich do you prefer?

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerWin_1
I don't like the sea because the\nsalty water burns my eyes!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerLose_1
Water in rivers is cold,\nbut it feels just super.

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PreBattle_2
Go, go, go! Go, my Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerWin_2
Good effort! Way to go,\nmy Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerLose_2
That's the way!\nWay to go, my Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PreBattle_3
I[.] I can swim, really!\nI don't need my inner tube!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerWin_3
I[.] I'm not lying!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerLose_3
It[.] It's true!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PreBattle_4
The beach sand is so hot!\pIt makes me go, "Ouch, ouch,\nouch!\"

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerWin_4
Ouch, ouch, ouch!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerLose_4
I love the sea!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PreBattle_5
I'm a girl in love with her inner\ntube! Nice to meet you!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerWin_5
Good-bye!\pI'm a girl in love with her inner\ntube!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerLose_5
Thank you!\pI'm a girl in love with her inner\ntube!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PreBattle_6
It's not like I can't swim.\nI just like my inner tube.

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerWin_6
Flip, flop!

#org @sFrontierText_Tuber_PlayerLose_6
Splish, splash!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PreBattle_1
Let me introduce to you my\ncherished partners!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerWin_1
The effort you put in is what's\nimportant.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerLose_1
How did you find them?\nMy cherished partners.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PreBattle_2
Raising Pok\emon takes a lot of\nhonest effort!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerWin_2
Urgwah! Look what you've done to\nmy Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerLose_2
Yahaha! I've had a hands-on time\nraising these Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PreBattle_3
I live among Pok\emon.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerWin_3
I'm just not much of a battler.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerLose_3
I've never been much of a battler,\nbut[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PreBattle_4
I'll check how your Pok\emon have\ngrown for you.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerWin_4
This is impressive!\pYou've raised your Pok\emon really\nthoroughly.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerLose_4
Not good enough!\pYour training style's not up to\npar.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PreBattle_5
It's no good to be too harsh[.]\nBut pampering is also out[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerWin_5
Being a Pok\emon Breeder is a deep\nand complex challenge.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerLose_5
Balance is key for raising good\nPok\emon.

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PreBattle_6
I specialize in raising cute\nPok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerWin_6
Oh, but they're so cute!

#org @sFrontierText_Pkmnbreeder_PlayerLose_6
Cute, yet strong! Right?

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PreBattle_1
You're going to lose, but you'll\nget to enjoy a nice aroma!

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PlayerWin_1
Ah[.] the scent of defeat.\nWhat a bitter taste it leaves[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PlayerLose_1
Kyahaha! That's what you get for\nswooning to my aroma!

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PreBattle_2
Smelling sweet scents makes me so\ndrowsy[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PlayerWin_2
[.]Yawn[.] Oh, really? I lost?

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PlayerLose_2
[.]Yawn[.] Oh? Are we finished\nso soon?

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PreBattle_3
Sniff[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PlayerWin_3
Ooohhh[.] the sweet scent of\nvictory!

#org @sFrontierText_Aromalady_PlayerLose_3
Can you smell that?\nThe scent of defeat!

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PreBattle_1
Exploring relics isn't all fun\nand games!

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PlayerWin_1
Danger lurks everywhere in ruins!

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PlayerLose_1
Your skill level says you probably\nwon't make a good Ruin Maniac.

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PreBattle_2
I travel around in search of lost\ntreasures.

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PlayerWin_2
You sure seem to be hectic.

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PlayerLose_2
The rest of the time, I fish and\ntend to crops every single day.

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PreBattle_3
These mates of mine traveled the\nworld with me!

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PlayerWin_3
Maybe it's time we hit the road\nagain[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Ruinmaniac_PlayerLose_3
What do you say?\nPretty tough, right?

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PreBattle_1
Let us paint a picture to last an\neternity!

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PlayerWin_1
Perhaps I should stick to painting\nlandscapes[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PlayerLose_1
The colors of your Pok\emon are\ndull.

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PreBattle_2
Hmmm[.] hold still right there!\nI must paint that powerful pose!

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PlayerWin_2
What a brilliant display! I would\nlove to paint your Pok\emon.

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PlayerLose_2
Oh, my dears! Your vivid colors\nhave shone through!

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PreBattle_3
Art isn't my only talent!

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PlayerWin_3
Aargh! I got some paint in\nmy eyes!

#org @sFrontierText_Painter_PlayerLose_3
I guess a style change from city\nskylines to battles was warranted!

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PreBattle_1
I won't lose to a child like you\nwho knows nothing of battles.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PlayerWin_1
What? This child is a fast learner?\nHa ha ha[.] I had no idea!

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PlayerLose_1
After all, you are an amateur.\nNo sweat.\p(Whew[.] That was a little too\nclose!)

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PreBattle_2
Argh. Cough, cough.\nI don't feel well.\pPlease show a little kindness.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PlayerWin_2
You are very sharp! You did not\nfall for my illness act.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PlayerLose_2
I lied when I said I did not feel\nwell! Experts do anything to win!

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PreBattle_3
I will give you a taste of an\nExpert's well-trained Pok\emon.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PlayerWin_3
You have served me a spicy defeat.\pAnd yet defeat is also part of\nlife.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertM_PlayerLose_3
How were the Expert's Pok\emon?\nDefeat is bitter, isn't it?

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PreBattle_1
Oh, you are so cute!\pCome, I promise to be nice in\nthis battle.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PlayerWin_1
Your battle is a little too cute.\nLet's play again sometime.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PlayerLose_1
You are so cute, really[.]\pI want to see you again.\nI'll be waiting.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PreBattle_2
Oh, you are still a child.\nWho said you could come here?

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PlayerWin_2
I thought you were a child.\nHee hee[.] You are tough[.]

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PlayerLose_2
You're not bad, but you're\nimmature.\pCome back when you've learned\nsomething.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PreBattle_3
Don't call me decrepit!\nA woman's mind is always blooming.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PlayerWin_3
I have pains in my eyes, my\nshoulder, and my back, but my\lheart is forever young.

#org @sFrontierText_ExpertF_PlayerLose_3
I'm not finished with love or\nPok\emon.\pI'll stay fit and ready all my\nlife.

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PreBattle_1
Join the Pok\efans.\nYour life will be happy!

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PlayerWin_1
If you join the Pok\efans, your\nlife will be saved!

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PlayerLose_1
If you join the Pok\efans, you will\nbe strong like me!

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PreBattle_2
I am not a regular Pok\efan.\nI am a major mega-Pok\efan!

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PlayerWin_2
You'll remember this!\nI am a big Pok\efan!

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PlayerLose_2
I love Pok\emon!\nI love love Pok\emon!

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PreBattle_3
I think I am a Pok\efan, therefore\nI am a Pok\efan.

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PlayerWin_3
You should remember this.\nI am a Pok\efan.

#org @sFrontierText_PokefanM_PlayerLose_3
The Pok\efan is power.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PreBattle_1
I took this job because I wanted to\nbe needed by someone.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PlayerWin_1
When a patient leaves the hospital,\nI feel happy but a bit sad.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PlayerLose_1
My job is hard, but I am happy to\nhelp people.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PreBattle_2
Grown-ups have a lot of hobbies.\nActually, I am a uniform collector.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PlayerWin_2
You realized that I am a fake\nNurse!\pYes, I am just a uniform collector.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PlayerLose_2
I am not a Nurse.\nI wear this uniform just for fun.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PreBattle_3
Even if you are injured, I will\ntreat you.\pSo let's fight hard.

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PlayerWin_3
You went too far! I will bill you\nthe cost of my medical expenses!

#org @sFrontierText_Nurse_PlayerLose_3
Sorry! I went too far. Do you\nrequire immediate hospitalization?

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PreBattle_1
I don't mean to brag, but my battling\nhas made quite a splash overseas!

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PlayerWin_1
Oh! There are strong trainers here,\ntoo?

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PlayerLose_1
I'm making waves!

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PreBattle_2
I once swam from Kanto to Sinnoh.\nCan you boast a similar feat?

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PlayerWin_2
Your battling is quite the feat!

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PlayerLose_2
Guess not!

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PreBattle_3
Isn't this swimsuit neat?\nIt's built to hold Pok\e Balls!

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PlayerWin_3
Better luck next time!

#org @sFrontierText_Swimmer_PlayerLose_3
I lost? Oh no!

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PreBattle_1
I've trained under my master for\nseven months. You can't win!

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PlayerWin_1
Heh, all according to keikaku.\n(Editor's note: keikaku means plan)

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PlayerLose_1
Must I train even harder?

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PreBattle_2
Don't cry when you lose, got it?\nI have an image to maintain.

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PlayerWin_2
W-What? Waaaah!

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PlayerLose_2
Remember, no crying.

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PreBattle_3
I'll defeat you in a flash. Your\nchallenge ends here!

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PlayerWin_3
So strong! Who trained you?

#org @sFrontierText_NinjaBoy_PlayerLose_3
Nothing personal, kid.

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PreBattle_1
The spirits[.] They warned me of your\ncoming.

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PlayerWin_1
Indeed[.] The spirits were correct\nabout you.

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PlayerLose_1
You have disappointed the spirits.

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PreBattle_2
Can you defeat that which you cannot\nsee? I wonder[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PlayerWin_2
Hm, so you can.

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PlayerLose_2
Hm, so you cannot.

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PreBattle_3
Your Pok\emon[.] I can sense their\nfear. Ehehehe[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PlayerWin_3
Not fear, but[.] Confidence?

#org @sFrontierText_Channeler_PlayerLose_3
Ehehehe[.] They remain fearful, even\nnow[.]

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PreBattle_1
Let's finish this quickly.\nI have a gnarly slope to hit.

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PlayerWin_1
Too fast!

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PlayerLose_1
Time to get going!

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PreBattle_2
You're gonna have a bad time.

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PlayerWin_2
Seems like you had a good time\ninstead?

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PlayerLose_2
You french fried when you should've\npizza'd.

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PreBattle_3
I'll finish this battle with a gold\nmedal worthy win!

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PlayerWin_3
Guess I'll have to settle for Silver.

#org @sFrontierText_Skier_PlayerLose_3
A photo finish!

// Frontier Aces (Streak 20)
#org @sFrontierText_Mort_PreBattle
Fancy seeing me here, huh? Let's\ngive the fans what they came for!

#org @sFrontierText_Mort_PlayerWin
Dynamite, baby!

#org @sFrontierText_Mort_PlayerLose
Oooh, and that's all she wrote,\nfolks!

#org @sFrontierText_Rival_PreBattle
Hey, [PLAYER]! I'm not going to hold\nback, so you shouldn't either!

#org @sFrontierText_Rival_PlayerWin
Haha, that's why you're the best!

#org @sFrontierText_Rival_PlayerLose
My streak continues! Nice!

#org @sFrontierText_Selene_PreBattle
I hope you'll give me yet another\nexcellent battle, [PLAYER]!

#org @sFrontierText_Selene_PlayerWin
Fantastic! That was battling worthy\nof Kulure's champion.

#org @sFrontierText_Selene_PlayerLose
That was fun!

#org @sFrontierText_Alistair_PreBattle
[PLAYER], don't hold back. I want to\nsee how much stronger I've become.

#org @sFrontierText_Alistair_PlayerWin
We have a ways to go still.\nDon't worry, we enjoyed ourselves.

#org @sFrontierText_Alistair_PlayerLose
Did you go easy on me?

#org @sFrontierText_Collin_PreBattle
Hey! I didn't expect to find you\nhere. Let's have a great battle!

#org @sFrontierText_Collin_PlayerWin
You're enjoying Amethyst, I hope?

#org @sFrontierText_Collin_PlayerLose
Keep getting stronger.\nI know you can do it!

#org @sFrontierText_Crystal_PreBattle
#org @sFrontierText_Crystal_PlayerWin
#org @sFrontierText_Crystal_PlayerLose

#org @sFrontierText_Brendan_PreBattle
I'm something of a big shot overseas.\nThink you can handle me?

#org @sFrontierText_Brendan_PlayerWin
Haha, perfect! Kulurian trainers\nreally are something else!

#org @sFrontierText_Brendan_PlayerLose
Nope!

#org @sFrontierText_May_PreBattle
I heard the Kulurian champion is\nstrong. Is that you?

#org @sFrontierText_May_PlayerWin
You're as good as they say you are!

#org @sFrontierText_May_PlayerLose
I must've been mistaken.

// Frontier Brains (Streak 50)
#org @sFrontierText_Terrence_PreBattle
[PLAYER], it's good to see you.\pI can't wait to see how much\nstronger you've become since our\lfirst battle.\pDon't let me down, okay?

#org @sFrontierText_Terrence_PlayerWin
You've grown so much.\nIt's wonderful to see!

#org @sFrontierText_Terrence_PlayerLose
Hmm[.] I see. Your technique needs a\nbit more work.

#org @sFrontierText_Stella_PreBattle
Um[.] When they asked me to become a\nFrontier Brain, I was reluctant[.]\pEven still, I won't disservice the\nrole I've been given.\pI hope you're ready, [PLAYER]! I\nwon't hold back!

#org @sFrontierText_Stella_PlayerWin
Well done! Exactly what I'd expect\nfrom our new champion.

#org @sFrontierText_Stella_PlayerLose
Perhaps we'll battle again someday.

#org @sFrontierText_Raine_PreBattle
Greetings, [PLAYER].\pDo you see the crowd? They've come\nout to see our magnificent battle!\pLet's show them an elegant dance.

#org @sFrontierText_Raine_PlayerWin
Exquisite!

#org @sFrontierText_Raine_PlayerLose
You've tripped up a bit.

#org @sFrontierText_Chance_PreBattle
Wahaha! [PLAYER], long time no see!\pI assume it isn't luck that has\nbrought you this far, huh?\pCome on, show me how you can play\nthe field!

#org @sFrontierText_Chance_PlayerWin
Excellent focus, [PLAYER]! This is\nwhy you're among the best.

#org @sFrontierText_Chance_PlayerLose
Looks like the house always wins.

#org @sFrontierText_Casey_PreBattle
[PLAYER]! It's so good to see you\nagain.\pLook around you. Your passion for\nbattling has caught everyone's\lattention.\pLet's show them a good time, yeah?

#org @sFrontierText_Casey_PlayerWin
And the crowd goes wild!

#org @sFrontierText_Casey_PlayerLose
Better luck next time.

#org @sFrontierText_Abby_PreBattle
Hmph. Only the strong come here.\nThat would explain your presence.\p[PLAYER], I expect a good battle\nfrom you. Don't disappoint me.

#org @sFrontierText_Abby_PlayerWin
Yes, good. Only you can push me to\nmy limits like that.

#org @sFrontierText_Abby_PlayerLose
What a disappointment.

#org @sFrontierText_Iris_PreBattle
Long time no see, [PLAYER]!\pDon't assume that I'll go easy on\nyou, just because we're friends.\pWe both have a reputation to keep,\nright?

#org @sFrontierText_Iris_PlayerWin
That was a fun battle!

#org @sFrontierText_Iris_PlayerLose
Thems the breaks!

#org @sFrontierText_Dennis_PreBattle
Yo, [PLAYER]! I just couldn't get\nour last battle out of my head.\pYou know what that means, right? It's\ntime for a rematch.\pAnd this time, I'm gonna win and\nshow the world how good I am!

#org @sFrontierText_Dennis_PlayerWin
Agh! I've lost again. That's fine[.]\nDee doesn't need to know.

#org @sFrontierText_Dennis_PlayerLose
Look at the crowd, pouring their\nadoration over me. Beautiful!

#endif
